            },
            {
                "location": "Section III.E (Discussion)",
                "lesson": "Three ISC technologies have different pros/cons: wireless sensing (mature, simple), multi-modal (robust, higher performance), crowdsensing (low cost, scalable). Each requires different design approaches.",
                "locator": "L258-262"
            },
            {
                "location": "Section IV.E (Discussion)",
                "lesson": "Three ISAC paradigms have unique advantages/challenges: integrated wireless (low cost, mature), multi-modal (abundant prior knowledge), crowdsensing (massive data). Dataset and fusion technique development needed.",
                "locator": "L332-340"
            },
            {
                "location": "Section VI.C (Discussion)",
